  "description": "Ruby sets out to find the Black Wolf Clan to rescue the kidnapped rabbit clan. After wandering the snowy mountains for days and growing hungry, Ruby discovers a carrot.\n\n *“A delicious carrot, I’ll enjoy this! Mmm—”\n\n“Aaaargh!”*\n\nEvery time she licks the dry carrot with her tongue, it keeps getting bigger…? The true identity of the carrot she’s happily biting into… is that of Ivan, the leader of the Black Wolf Clan’s… private parts?!\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
